{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Caspian was a majestic paprilus - a creature with the wings of a butterfly and the body of a lion. His delicate wings shimmered with iridescent colors, reflecting the hues of the rainbow. Caspian's home was the Luminous Forest, where he flitted from flower to flower, collecting nectar to create magical potions. With his gentle touch, he could heal the wounded and bring solace to the sorrowful. The ancient trees of the forest revered Caspian, for his paprilus magic maintained the balance of nature. As the seasons changed, Caspian's wings would transform, adapting to the shifting colors of the world. His beauty and kindness earned him the title of Guardian of the Forest, and his legend lived on as a symbol of hope and wonder.",
